Author: Liang He <windhl@126.com>
Date:   Thu Nov 10 20:26:01 2022 +0800

    scsi: ufs: host: Hold reference returned by of_parse_phandle()

    stable inclusion
    from stable-v5.10.135
    commit 54a73d65440e8e4683306ef5c25a4525fc8b701e

    Reference: https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git/commit/?id=54a73d65440e8e4683306ef5c25a4525fc8b701e

    --------------------------------

    commit a3435afba87dc6cd83f5595e7607f3c40f93ef01 upstream.

    In ufshcd_populate_vreg(), we should hold the reference returned by
    of_parse_phandle() and then use it to call of_node_put() for refcount
    balance.

    Link: https://lore.kernel.org/r/20220719071529.1081166-1-windhl@126.com
    Reviewed-by: Bart Van Assche <bvanassche@acm.org>
    Signed-off-by: Liang He <windhl@126.com>
